  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🗿</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🗿</span>🗿 </span><strong><span style=\"color:#808080\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\">摩艾石像</span>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:36px\">🗿</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">🗿</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🗿</span></strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://c.tenor.com/9QWHYsTOCYMAAAAd/intese-moyai.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"640\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Discord&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;message=Twitter&amp;\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&amp;color=2d2d2d&amp;labelColor=dddddd&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Youtube&amp;message=Twitter&amp;logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fLjWse7.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>🗿 摩艾石像小知識🗿</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">在遊戲中加入摩艾石像。你還想從模組中得到什麼？<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">偶爾可以在海灘上找到，或在蘑菇島上更常見。<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">每天可以打招呼一次<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">滿月時會隨機移動<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">成群時會互相交談<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以堆疊&nbsp;<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">擁有獨特的音盒聲響<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以用來製作鐵巨人<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以吃肥皂<br><br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">受重力影響，落下時會對實體造成大量傷害</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以製作成煙火之星</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">請注意，Fabric版本目前缺少許多這些功能</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更多🗿請前往<a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fLjWse7.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">模組製作佔用了我很多時間，所以如果你喜歡我的作品，並想支持我，可以在這裡進行。如果你支持我，你將獲得一個專屬的<strong>地球儀</strong>和/或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果你使用\"supplementaries\"代碼從Akliz購買伺服器，這也適用。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要伺服器？看看Akliz，他們有專為模組Minecraft設計的頂級品牌伺服器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他們有一個溫馨的社區，提供優質的支援，伺服器運行出色</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用代碼\"supplementaries\"可享<strong>&nbsp;20%折扣</strong>&nbsp;，同時也支持我！</span></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fLjWse7.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我們的模組🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\">